# Claude AI
# Ignore everything under .claude EXCEPT the checked-in skills, which document
# how to work on this repo and are meant to be shared with contributors.
# Note: git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded, so
# this must exclude .claude/* rather than .claude/ itself.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
.clauderc
**/CLAUDE.md
SPECS.md

# Build artifacts
bin/
dist/
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# Generated files
# Module stubs in /library/ are checked in (regenerated by `make gen-stubs`).
# Type-registry stubs (annotations.gen.lua) are runtime artefacts wherever they land.
annotations.gen.lua
**/annotations.gen.lua
example/library/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
